# Files consumed by Linux tools (bash, Docker BuildKit, dosbox-on-Linux)
# must stay LF even when checked out on Windows.  Without this, a fresh
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would give the dl2build image a
# CRLF entrypoint.sh, and bash would fail with "bad interpreter".
*.sh                text eol=lf
docker/Dockerfile   text eol=lf
docker/dosbox.conf  text eol=lf
